From: ohos-ports contributors
Subject: [PATCH] package: add opt-in Electron-OH pilot metadata

Base: better-sqlite3 v13.0.3, after patches 0001 and 0002.
The default JS entrypoint, loader, dependencies and Node prebuild are unchanged.
README.electron-oh.md is copied by electron-oh/build-electron-oh.sh. prebuilds/** already
includes the new Electron-OH binary and its manifest.

--- a/package.json
+++ b/package.json
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 {
   "name": "@ohos-ports/better-sqlite3",
-  "version": "13.0.3",
+  "version": "13.0.3-electron-oh.0",
   "description": "The fastest and simplest library for SQLite in Node.js. — OpenHarmony (OHOS) port.",
   "homepage": "http://github.com/WiseLibs/better-sqlite3",
   "author": "Joshua Wise <joshuathomaswise@gmail.com>",
@@ -35,5 +35,6 @@
     "lib/**",
     "deps/**",
+    "README.electron-oh.md",
     "prebuilds/**"
   ],
   "gypfile": false,
